{# RumourEngine: who is keen to pass something on. The "Interjects when" line is
   read by the GameMaster, which starts conversations, and by the speaker
   selector, which picks who joins one. Only a pointer, cut short: the whole
   item, and the nudge to raise it, is in their bio (0812_rumourengine_talk).
   Built in C++ (Delivery::BuildNews), for gossips only. #}
